commit 6bbae9e96d6741a6d379d1c620660721eb6da829
Author: Rishi Chhibber <rishi.chhibber@broadcom.com>
Date:   Thu May 7 22:26:51 2026 -0700

    linux-esx: Add DTLS Zero Copy kernel module

    This kernel driver is for the DTLS Zero Copy virtual device. This driver
    helps the userspace applications to communicate with the VDSM
    device which facilitates the sharing of memory between the workload
    VMs and the SCRX

    Signed-off-by: Rishi Chhibber <rishi.chhibber@broadcom.com>

